    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FREEDOM OF APPROACH</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/b2f0cbba35db9473a90efa93f1ce6c95.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/b2f0cbba35db9473a90efa93f1ce6c95.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/b2f0cbba35db9473a90efa93f1ce6c95.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive into a stealth-action experience where every decision is yours to make. In this game, levels are your playground, offering multiple paths to success. From silent infiltrations to strategic diversions, choose your approach and shape the narrative. Each mission is an opportunity to showcase your creativity and tactical prowess. Unleash your style, conquer challenges, and redefine stealth-action gaming. <br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>COMPLETE YOUR OBJECTIVES</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/1fb86ee46a84b91ecae9d3c5160aa8bb.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/1fb86ee46a84b91ecae9d3c5160aa8bb.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/1fb86ee46a84b91ecae9d3c5160aa8bb.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on high-stakes missions assigned by The Great Donke. Your objectives vary from eliminating targets to securing top-secret documents. In this immersive stealth-action game, choose your approach \u2013 be it silent infiltration or bold confrontation. Adapt and improvise to complete your goals, making each mission a unique puzzle to solve. <br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>CUSTOMIZE YOUR EQUIPMENTS</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/76740186efd478925c87e7257b242862.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/76740186efd478925c87e7257b242862.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/76740186efd478925c87e7257b242862.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shape your playstyle by personalizing weapons \u2013 from shotguns piercing walls to snipers with bouncing bullets. Craft your own assassin identity, turning a simple pistol into a deadly killing machine with equipping abilities instead of heavy weapons. This stealth-action game invites you to experiment, adapt, and dominate with a customized arsenal that defines your unique approach.<br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>PLAY TO PERSONLIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/dca4fbfb0a89cf0687d9c9b4f40af229.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/dca4fbfb0a89cf0687d9c9b4f40af229.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/dca4fbfb0a89cf0687d9c9b4f40af229.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> Every level is a stepping stone to enhancing your arsenal and unlocking new abilities. Complete challenges to refine your weapons and shape your unique playstyle. The more you conquer, the more enjoyable your gameplay becomes. Remember, your rewards are tailored to your chosen approach, ensuring a dynamic and personalized experience with every mission. Dive into a cycle of improvement, where mastery equals customization, and your journey is as unique as your skills.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FREEDOM OF APPROACH</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/b2f0cbba35db9473a90efa93f1ce6c95.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/b2f0cbba35db9473a90efa93f1ce6c95.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/b2f0cbba35db9473a90efa93f1ce6c95.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive into a stealth-action experience where every decision is yours to make. In this game, levels are your playground, offering multiple paths to success. From silent infiltrations to strategic diversions, choose your approach and shape the narrative. Each mission is an opportunity to showcase your creativity and tactical prowess. Unleash your style, conquer challenges, and redefine stealth-action gaming. <br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>COMPLETE YOUR OBJECTIVES</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/1fb86ee46a84b91ecae9d3c5160aa8bb.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/1fb86ee46a84b91ecae9d3c5160aa8bb.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/1fb86ee46a84b91ecae9d3c5160aa8bb.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on high-stakes missions assigned by The Great Donke. Your objectives vary from eliminating targets to securing top-secret documents. In this immersive stealth-action game, choose your approach \u2013 be it silent infiltration or bold confrontation. Adapt and improvise to complete your goals, making each mission a unique puzzle to solve. <br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>CUSTOMIZE YOUR EQUIPMENTS</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/76740186efd478925c87e7257b242862.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/76740186efd478925c87e7257b242862.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/76740186efd478925c87e7257b242862.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shape your playstyle by personalizing weapons \u2013 from shotguns piercing walls to snipers with bouncing bullets. Craft your own assassin identity, turning a simple pistol into a deadly killing machine with equipping abilities instead of heavy weapons. This stealth-action game invites you to experiment, adapt, and dominate with a customized arsenal that defines your unique approach.<br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>PLAY TO PERSONLIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/dca4fbfb0a89cf0687d9c9b4f40af229.poster.avif?t=1746366714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/dca4fbfb0a89cf0687d9c9b4f40af229.webm?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835760/extras/dca4fbfb0a89cf0687d9c9b4f40af229.mp4?t=1746366714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> Every level is a stepping stone to enhancing your arsenal and unlocking new abilities. Complete challenges to refine your weapons and shape your unique playstyle. The more you conquer, the more enjoyable your gameplay becomes. Remember, your rewards are tailored to your chosen approach, ensuring a dynamic and personalized experience with every mission. Dive into a cycle of improvement, where mastery equals customization, and your journey is as unique as your skills.",
    "short_description": "Thus Spoke the Donke is an immersive stealth-action game that casts you as a mercenary assassin. Customize your weapons and abilities, equip them according to your play style. Find the way to complete your mission either stealthily or through pure action with the help of personalized gameplay.",
